# The built front end in the source distribution.
#
# `python -m build` builds the wheel from the extracted sdist, and `setup.py`
# copies `web/dist` into `rhizome_graph/web/` from wherever it is run -- so if the
# archive does not carry the raw build output, the wheel made from it has no page.
# The sdist keeps it at `web/dist/`, the same place a checkout keeps it; only the
# wheel moves it inside the import package.
#
# `web/dist` is gitignored build output and usually absent. A `graft` that matches
# nothing is a warning, not an error, which is the whole reason this can be
# declared unconditionally.
graft web/dist
